NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/memory.typeHalfLife kind=func
  digest=b3:df638e106171c4ee930ea5d7d5f3f8cb6b37ca3c8464adc28c0497a777ea5b22 file=neo/internal/memory/salience_realism.go range=37:57 lang=go exported=false byte_range=1461:2377
  sig=func typeHalfLife(typ string) time.Duration
  doc=typeHalfLife returns the Neo-side recency half-life for a memory type (the\nv2 "salience realism" table). A zero duration means "no decay": Identity is\npermanent, and any type the table does not cover (Event, Pattern,\nCapability, Unknown) is deliberately left undecayed so the re-rank never\npenalizes a type the plan did not account for.
